<title>CHINA: South China Industries shares suspended.</title>
<headline>South China Industries shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in South China Industries Ltd shares was suspended on Wednesday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.</p>
<p>The stock rose HK$0.03 to HK$1.09 ahead of the suspension.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
